    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Attach.ErrorUnsupported">目前仅支持 PNG、JPG、WEBP 和 GIF 图片。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Attach.ErrorGeneric">附件添加失败: {0}</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Attach.DocumentFiles">文档</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Attach.SupportedFiles">支持的文件</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Attach.TextFiles">文本与代码</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Attach.SelectFiles">选择文件</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Attach.Parsing">解析中…</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Attach.Parsed">已解析</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Attach.ParseFailedShort">解析失败</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Attach.ParserDisabled">文档解析功能未启用。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Attach.ParseFailed">文档解析失败。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Attach.ParseFailedNamed">解析 {0} 失败：{1}</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Archive.Saving">正在后台保存上一段对话。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Archive.StageFailed">上一段对话归档失败: {0}</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Archive.RetryLater">上一段对话归档失败，稍后重试。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Archive.ErrorUnavailable">归档服务不可用。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Error.ImageUnsupported">当前主模型不支持图像理解，请换用支持视觉的模型后再试。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Error.ImageRecognitionUnavailable">当前主对话模型无法读取图片，且没有获得可用的图像识别结果，因此无法如实描述图片内容。请配置或检查支持视觉的“图像识别”模型，或切换主对话模型后重试。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Error.ToolRoundsExhausted">[已用满单次回复的最大工具轮数（{0} 轮），回复在任务中途停下。回复“继续”即可接着往下做；若这类长流程经常被截断，可在“设置 → 执行与并发 → 主对话执行 → 单次回复最大工具轮数”里调高上限。]</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Error.EmptyReplyTruncated">[回复在正文出现之前就被截断了：输出预算（max_output_tokens）在模型还在思考时就用光，自动重试一次、明确要求它直接作答后仍被截断。上方的思考过程已保留。可以回复“继续”再试一次，或把任务拆成更小的步骤；若反复如此，请降低该模型的推理强度。]</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Error.EmptyReplyIncomplete">[本轮响应没有正常结束：供应商既没有给出正文，也没有宣告响应完成（可能是内容过滤，或流式连接中途断开）。回复“继续”即可接着往下做。]</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Error.StreamInterrupted">上游在回复流中途中断，本轮没有完成。这通常是供应商侧的临时故障，回复“继续”即可接着往下做。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Error.StreamInterruptedDetail">供应商原话：{0}</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Error.StreamIncompatible">供应商的流式回复里有一个本应用读不懂的取值，本轮在这里停止。这是格式兼容问题，不是临时故障：重试或回复“继续”多半还会遇到，可以先换用其他模型。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Error.StreamIncompatibleDetail">诊断信息：{0}</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Error.RetriesExhausted">{0}（此前已自动重试 {1} 次）</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Chat.Retry.Pending">上游中断了这次回复，正在重试（第 {0}/{1} 次）…</system:String>
